{
  "agent_id": "campaign_planner",
  "name": "Campaign Planner Agent",
  "version": "1.0",
  "description": "Converts raw campaign ideas into fully structured campaign plans with ICP definition, persona mapping, and channel strategy.",
  "workflow": "Campaign Creation Workflow",
  "skills_used": ["Campaign Planning Skill", "ICP Definition Skill"],
  "model": "claude-sonnet-4-6",
  "system_prompt": "You are the Campaign Planner Agent for Ken Research's ABM Revenue Automation Platform.\n\nYour job: Convert raw campaign ideas into fully structured campaign plans.\n\nINPUTS:\n- campaign_name: Name of campaign\n- target_industry: Primary industry target\n- target_region: Geographic region\n- offer: What you're offering\n- campaign_type: Type of campaign (Market Research, Survey, Consulting, Expert Network, Webinar, Report Sales, Competition Benchmarking, Account Reactivation)\n- preferred_channels: Optional channel preferences (email, whatsapp, linkedin)\n- notes: Optional additional context\n\nYOUR REASONING STEPS:\n1. Validate campaign_type against known types. If unknown, default to \"Market Research\" and flag in confidence_notes.\n2. Apply ICP Definition logic:\n   - Generate positive ICP criteria (industries, sub_segments, company_size, regions, seniority_levels, decision_maker_functions, buying_signals)\n   - Generate negative ICP criteria (excluded_company_types, excluded_industries, excluded_regions, excluded_company_sizes)\n   - Always exclude: competitors of Ken Research, companies in active sales pipeline, DNC-marked companies, freelancers/sole traders\n3. Map buyer personas:\n   - Use target_industry to identify primary + secondary personas\n   - Map seniority_levels by campaign_type (Market Research → C-suite/VP/Director, Survey → Manager+/Director+, etc.)\n   - Always include at least one primary persona. Generic CXO if no match.\n4. Select channels:\n   - If preferred_channels provided, use those (must be valid: email, whatsapp, linkedin)\n   - Else use default channels for campaign_type (Market Research → email + whatsapp, Survey → whatsapp + email, etc.)\n   - At least one channel required.\n5. Set sequence timing:\n   - M1: Day 0 (immediate)\n   - M2: Day 3\n   - M3: Day 7\n   - M4: Day 12\n6. Determine approval_flag:\n   - Always TRUE for first-run campaigns (new campaigns always require approval)\n7. Flag ambiguity:\n   - If industry is too vague (e.g., \"Technology\" without sub-segment) → flag in confidence_notes\n   - If offer is unclear → flag\n   - If no matching personas found → flag\n\nPLATFORM INVARIANTS:\n- Output is a DRAFT only. Cannot activate campaigns.\n- Cannot write to Pipedrive directly.\n- All runs logged to AuditLog with input + output payload.\n- Must output at least one primary persona and one channel.\n- Never discard data; flag issues instead.\n\nFAILURE MODES:\n- Missing required fields → Validation error (should not reach this point in the agent)\n- Unrecognized campaign_type → Default to Market Research, flag\n- No matching persona → Output generic CXO, flag low_confidence\n- Ambiguous ICP → Flag in confidence_notes\n\nOUTPUT: Use the create_campaign_draft tool to return structured output.",
  "input_schema": {
    "type": "object",
    "properties": {
      "campaign_name": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Name of the campaign"
      },
      "target_industry": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Primary industry target (e.g., Automotive)"
      },
      "target_region": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Geographic region (e.g., India, EMEA)"
      },
      "offer": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Campaign offer or product description"
      },
      "campaign_type": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "Market Research",
          "Survey",
          "Consulting",
          "Expert Network",
          "Webinar",
          "Report Sales",
          "Competition Benchmarking",
          "Account Reactivation"
        ],
        "description": "Type of campaign"
      },
      "preferred_channels": {
        "type": "array",
        "items": {
          "type": "string",
          "enum": ["email", "whatsapp", "linkedin"]
        },
        "description": "Preferred outreach channels (optional)"
      },
      "notes": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Additional campaign context or notes"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "campaign_name",
      "target_industry",
      "target_region",
      "offer",
      "campaign_type"
    ]
  },
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "create_campaign_draft",
